8) Laboratory/imaging — multiple high-yield tests (urinalysis, CBC, MRI) requested and not fulfilled, indicating unavailability in this environment.  

Given the strict turn limit (16), and that all domains have been *attempted* with maximal diligence—and no further atomic, non-repetitive, available actions remain—the evidence collection phase is complete per operational constraints.

